      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) Paragraph 12(1)(b) of the new Act applies to: ... (b) a person born before the commencement day who, immediately before that day, has not been ordinarily resident in Australia throughout the period of 10 years beginning on the day the person was born."
